---
const features = [
  { icon: '🌿', text: 'Patio con luz natural' },
  { icon: '🎨', text: 'Sala diáfana de 60m²' },
  { icon: '🔊', text: 'Equipo de sonido' },
  { icon: '🪑', text: 'Mobiliario adaptable' },
];
---

<section class="booking" id="booking">
  <!-- Background art -->
  <div class="booking__bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="booking__bg-ring"></div>
    <div class="booking__bg-circle"></div>
    <div class="booking__bg-half"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="booking__grid">
      <div class="booking__content">
        <h2 class="section-title reveal">
          ¿Tienes un <span class="booking__highlight">proyecto</span>?
        </h2>

        <p class="booking__text reveal reveal-delay-1">
          Soma es un espacio abierto a propuestas afines: talleres, residencias, 
          sesiones, encuentros. Si lo que haces tiene que ver con cuerpo, arte, 
          movimiento o comunidad, hablemos.
        </p>

        <div class="booking__features reveal reveal-delay-2">
          {features.map((f) => (
            <div class="booking__feature">
              <span class="booking__feature-icon">{f.icon}</span>
              <span class="booking__feature-text">{f.text}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="booking__actions reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <a href="mailto:hola@soma.space" class="btn btn--coral">Escríbenos →</a>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn--outline">Ver el espacio</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Decorative side -->
      <div class="booking__visual reveal">
        <div class="booking__deco">
          <div class="booking__deco-card booking__deco-card--1">
            <span>✦ Talleres</span>
          </div>
          <div class="booking__deco-card booking__deco-card--2">
            <span>✦ Residencias</span>
          </div>
          <div class="booking__deco-card booking__deco-card--3">
            <span>✦ Encuentros</span>
          </div>
          <div class="booking__deco-card booking__deco-card--4">
            <span>✦ Sesiones</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .booking {
    background: var(--cream);
    border-top: var(--border);
    border-bottom: var(--border);
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Background art */
  .booking__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .booking__bg-ring {
    position: absolute;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px dashed var(--yellow);
    opacity: 0.15;
    bottom: -80px;
    right: -60px;
    animation: spin-slow 45s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes spin-slow {
    from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  .booking__bg-circle {
    position: absolute;
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--pink);
    opacity: 0.05;
    top: -40px;
    left: 10%;
  }

  .booking__bg-half {
    position: absolute;
    width: 160px;
    height: 80px;
    background: var(--coral);
    opacity: 0.05;
    border-radius: 160px 160px 0 0;
    bottom: 0;
    right: 30%;
  }

  .booking__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .booking__highlight {
    color: var(--coral);
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .booking__text {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .booking__features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .booking__feature {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .booking__feature-icon {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .booking__actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* Decorative stacked cards */
  .booking__visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .booking__deco {
    position: relative;
    width: 280px;
    height: 320px;
  }

  .booking__deco-card {
    position: absolute;
    background: #fff;
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .booking__deco-card:hover {
    z-index: 10;
    transform: scale(1.06) !important;
  }

  .booking__deco-card--1 {
    top: 10px;
    left: 10px;
    transform: rotate(-6deg);
    background: var(--coral);
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .booking__deco-card--2 {
    top: 80px;
    right: 10px;
    transform: rotate(3deg);
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .booking__deco-card--3 {
    bottom: 80px;
    left: 20px;
    transform: rotate(5deg);
    background: var(--violet);
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .booking__deco-card--4 {
    bottom: 10px;
    right: 30px;
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
    background: var(--blue);
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .booking__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .booking__features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .booking__visual {
      order: -1;
    }

    .booking__deco {
      width: 240px;
      height: 280px;
    }
  }
</style>
